[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0010","text":"辛苦了，果穗\n表演很棒————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0020","text":"制作人\n最喜欢您了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0030","text":"诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0040","text":"嗯？怎么了，突然……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0050","text":"粉丝们对我说“果穗酱最喜欢你了！”\n我超级开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0060","text":"制作人，\n见到小狗的时候，吃点心的时候——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0070","text":"我说“喜欢”的时候您都对我笑了，\n所以我也想对您说！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0080","text":"不行吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0090","text":"……不！\n我很开心，谢谢你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900200_03_0100","text":"（她完全没有别的意思所以应该没问题，\n　但这种场合还是会有点防备啊……！）"}]
